{%- comment -%}
  Price, GST note and the Afterpay instalment line.

  The instalment is divided from the real product price rather than typed in,
  so it cannot fall out of step if the price changes. Shopify prices are in
  cents, so the division happens before the money filter.

  Accepts: product
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign instalment = product.price | divided_by: 4 -%}

<div class="ss-price">
  <span>{{ product.price | money }}</span>
  <span class="ss-price__gst">AUD, GST included</span>
</div>

<p class="ss-instalment">
  or 4 instalments of <b>{{ instalment | money }}</b> with Afterpay
</p>
